{"unit_id":"XiLuovo__dsh-session-timeline#card-zh","repo":"XiLuovo/dsh-session-timeline","commit":"a06e80b43f9b1612454f0a3069d2ec94a6c727df","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-timeline 是面向 DSH Web 的会话导航插件，在对话区左侧显示按用户消息排列的横线时间轴。它通过 sessionProjections 汇总会话消息与回复预览，并把交互界面注册到 shell.overlay。主要功能包括滚动定位当前消息、悬停查看问答摘要、点击跳转到历史消息，以及收起和展开时间轴。适合需要在较长对话中快速浏览和定位轮次的 DSH Web 用户。需要宿主提供 sessions、shell.overlay 和 sessionProjections。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-5","index.js:46-87","client.js:546-562"]}
{"unit_id":"XiLuovo__dsh-session-timeline#card-en","repo":"XiLuovo/dsh-session-timeline","commit":"a06e80b43f9b1612454f0a3069d2ec94a6c727df","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-timeline adds a message timeline beside DSH Web conversations. It collects user turns and reply previews, tracks the current turn, previews content on hover, jumps to earlier messages, and can be collapsed. It requires the host sessions, shell.overlay, and sessionProjections services.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-5","index.js:46-87","client.js:546-562"]}
